    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Common, treatable, and not caused by circumcision\",\"title\":\"Buried or hidden penis\",\"lede\":\"A buried penis is when some or all of the penis is hidden within the surrounding pubic tissue. It may be present from childhood or become more noticeable with changes in body shape or weight.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidar\\u0022\\u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)\\u003c/a\\u003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Reasons\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\"},{\"label\":\"Buried penis\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap-narrow\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap-narrow\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>It occurs when the pubic area is relatively prominent compared to the length of the penis. It is most common in babies when the baby is growing and has a lot of baby fat but the penis is not growing at the same rate. It often improves as the baby loses weight/ body composition changes and the penis grows. In older patients, the penis will become more prominent when they lose weight and fat in the pubic area.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We treat many patients with a buried penis and know how to recognize it. We are able to provide the circumcision that is appropriate to the size and length of the penis. We will also show the patient/ parents what the ongoing aftercare that is required with a buried penis.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Aftercare\",\"heading\":\"Aftercare where the penis remains buried\",\"html\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003cp\\u003eKeeping the circumcision line clean and dry is particularly important when the penis tends to retract into the surrounding tissue. The clinic will show you how to expose the area safely as part of the individual aftercare plan.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n        \\u003cp\\u003eFor a ring circumcision, the timing of this care differs from a forceps-guided circumcision, so follow the instructions given specifically for the method used.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n        \\u003cp\\u003eThe website overview is not a substitute for the clinic's current aftercare sheet or videos. See the \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/\\u0022\\u003eaftercare page\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n      \\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003eNext step\\u003c/span\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"display d-2\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-2\">Ask us about circumcision with a buried penis</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We treat many patients with a buried penis and know how to recognize it. We are able to provide the circumcision that is appropriate to the size and length of the penis.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022book-buried\\u0022\\u003eBook a consultation\\u003c/a\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn btn-ghost\\u0022 href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-buried\\u0022\\u003eCall 020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us about it\",\"formId\":\"buried\",\"subject\":\"buried penis enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"title\":\"Ask us anything before you decide\",\"text\":\"Most people call with a question rather than to book. That is what the phone is for, and nothing is booked until you say so.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book a consultation\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"Would you rather write than speak?\",\"cardHtml\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eA phone call asks you to be fluent and composed in the moment. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://wa.me/447886779958\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022whatsapp-cta\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003eWhatsApp\\u003c/a\\u003e does not. You can take your time, translate, and forward the answer to whoever else in the family needs to see it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:12px\\u0022\\u003eWe reply during opening hours, and we are used to the questions people feel awkward asking out loud.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->"
